  "subject": "🤖 AI Agents Daily — McKinsey: AI Agents Are Undercutting Banks' Automation Dividends | November 11, 2026",
  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <title>🤖 AI Agents Daily — McKinsey: AI Agents Are Undercutting Banks' Automation Dividends | November 11, 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f0f0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ OUTER WRAPPER -->\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f0f0f0\"\n       style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 10px;\">\n\n      <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n      <table width=\"680\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr><td>\n      <![endif]-->\n\n      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN CONTAINER -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n             style=\"max-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── HEADER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n              style=\"padding:40px 30px 28px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #009c6d;\">\n\n            <!-- Logo emoji -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;\">🤖</div>\n\n            <!-- Publication title -->\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\n                        line-height:1.2;\">\n              AI Agents Daily\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Tagline -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666666;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;\">\n              AI developments that matter for financial institutions\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Date -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n              November 11, 2026\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────── DEEP DIVE SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:40px 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Deep Dive 🔍\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article title -->\n            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.4;\">\n              McKinsey: AI Agents Are Undercutting Banks' Automation Dividends\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article body (HTML from Claude, inline-styled by email-builder) -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Overview</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">McKinsey has fired a direct warning at bank executives: the costs of deploying AI agents are quietly consuming the very savings they were supposed to generate. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNeDdsUV9aY2FBNVVsY0E1N1ZpMnNpTkV4ZTBQekJoQmpyblFFOERzS2ZRYTNfWTBJMlY5NXVPUjRwbUd5MTJ3RndMb29MX1lWd1d0S1hfNlNyUUVxME15X2NOc0hHb3c5RFZEOFNLUm5vb1YwOHFNNnZ4T2xLeXNmUHl3SEdabFpKc3UxNW5WVVF1RE8wUU44am04OUE1SExtX2N0cg?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">The analysis</a> flags a structural trap many banks are already walking into — incremental agent deployments funded by savings that haven't materialised yet.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">The Details</h3><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0 0 0 20px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">McKinsey finds that siloed, department-by-department agentic AI rollouts drive overhead costs that outpace efficiency gains.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><strong>Legacy core banking integration</strong> is the primary cost driver — connecting agents to decades-old systems is orders of magnitude more expensive than connecting them to cloud-native infrastructure.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Banks that automated on legacy RPA face disproportionately high upgrade costs when transitioning to agentic architectures.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Governance and monitoring infrastructure for autonomous agents adds a cost layer that most business cases never modelled.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">McKinsey's prescription: only <strong>coordinated, enterprise-wide agentic deployments</strong> with centralised cost accounting achieve net-positive automation economics.</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Why It Matters</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">This report should be required reading for every bank CFO approving AI agent project proposals. The pattern McKinsey describes — acquiring automation savings with one hand while spending them with the other — is precisely what happens when agent pilots are greenlit silo by silo, without central ROI tracking. Banks with dozens of active pilots and no enterprise cost model are running a risk they haven't yet priced.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">The implication for asset managers and insurers is equally pointed: agentic AI is not a drop-in upgrade to existing automation stacks. Firms that model ROI without accounting for agent governance, inference costs, and legacy plumbing will consistently overpromise. The winners will design enterprise AI architectures — and full total-cost models — before procurement, not after the pilots have already proliferated.</p>\n            </div>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Deep Dive → Things to Know -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── THINGS TO KNOW SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Things to Know 👀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Things to Know entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- TTK entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            1. <strong>Deutsche Bank and Ant set out roadmap for integrating agentic AI into wholesale banking</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPVlRmVVE5ZUN5bWlWa2VPOVJJb0Q5aTFnUTBfaXE0U1RZdTY5RXAxZndqamxQS0dOcHVlNU9qdHExUmNUZS1XeFd6VV9jdkxqTTllaXZHWjNmUGZtdTl0dHlnWjFEMEdtdmhYMTZsZnI4Z3EwMFF3WndiNHdVVlZRLUhjSl84WGNYNEJyOUZZQ0swMVozZnRVNXBHRnl6NFRNN2otaGVKcVprTkQzX056UWZiRk1BU1ViX084d2ZKSnQwYll5RTRaazR3?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Finextra Research</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Deutsche Bank and Ant Group have published a joint roadmap for embedding agentic AI across wholesale banking operations, covering trade finance, treasury, and client services. The collaboration signals growing institutional confidence in autonomous agents for high-value banking workflows.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>First-mover benchmark.</strong> Two global financial heavyweights going public with a wholesale agentic AI roadmap sets a competitive precedent — peers without a comparable plan will face pressure to accelerate their own timelines.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 2 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            2. <strong>BPI pilots agentic AI for small business loan approvals</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOMThnTTNiUjZaN052d2hURUVEczBJV3pubS1LOWhrZ2FWc292bVVQYzJ5ay00OVhKR3A5aEVFdXhEelphSUdiMmRtTjhDdUJOMGRCeXpfZ2dLOGgyb29uMGh3YmE0dVAtTVUtTGxfS29yLVBnWC1vU3h6OXZLaEVqU01MajhhVjgtVjFTalFEYngydUIyTVpz?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Traders Union</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Bank of the Philippine Islands is piloting an agentic AI system to automate small business loan approval decisions, reducing manual review time and broadening credit access for underserved SME segments in the Philippines.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Credit automation moves into production.</strong> BPI's pilot is an early real-world test of agentic AI in lending decisions — a space where explainability requirements, bias risk, and regulatory scrutiny will intensify fast as adoption spreads.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 3 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            3. <strong>With IPO looming, Anthropic launches new AI models, workplace tools</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQS1MwT2h1RTlJWFZHV1NGdFFBSkp5a2N0LTdKRnNnaHJQODNjdm1ULWRURTFrTTdPUkhHSTlvQWdqT0hOclZDMnl2NnpvQ19fZEJfbEFDbU5wLWRMOTB6LU9yRURtTjlkbzJPWlJlM1VGSzRqR3RzUVVoeDlyMTU1Mk1GY1Bsc01iTzM1anZ1Mkx0Y3J1LXppN2s2U2VTbGtNNGtjX3c3clA?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">TechTarget</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Anthropic has launched new AI models and enterprise workplace tools ahead of a reported IPO. The release includes updates to Claude-based products aimed at enterprise workflows, as the company accelerates commercialisation of its model stack.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Vendor risk calculus shifts.</strong> An Anthropic IPO changes the procurement calculus for banks using Claude-based tools — expect stricter SLAs, broader enterprise support tiers, and increased competitive pressure on AI vendor pricing.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 4 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            4. <strong>Amazon Replaces Claude Sonnet 4.6 With In-House Model, Cutting Ticket-Processing Costs by 98%</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTFBwaFRKVTN6Q2w1Nzk3U01qOEc3MVY0azR1Y0YwWVg2WkpIZVFmVkJPODdOM0VHSDN2aWV1dHNGTzc0bkltVEIzVC1TVzdrenQ4YnVoN3B3VklFVGZNTmxYdGttc19ZcV9GZXpkSGZPOUdFdVNFenc?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">BigGo Finance</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Amazon has replaced a third-party Claude model with a proprietary in-house model for internal ticket processing, reporting a 98% reduction in per-ticket AI inference costs. The move highlights the economics of vertically-integrated AI for high-volume repetitive enterprise workflows.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Build vs buy — with numbers.</strong> Amazon's 98% cost reduction after moving to an in-house model is a data point every bank CTO will cite when making the case for internal model development at scale.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 5 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            5. <strong>BioCatch Launches AI Detection Tool to Identify Automated Agents in Online Banking</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNcENiSERGNHRDQ2o2MnlibWJiMEREeFBteXZLaWVqVUJHMkNxMmFhVWJsSVRrSzBvYjVoSmQ1QUJfY19HZ3V1eXhsVm9zbGcxb2oxQzctTU9pbjlLbm5sQldiUi1uQnNXX0JjZzV2S3dCWi1rb2NoSXB5VWR0R0NSSA?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">TechTimes</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            BioCatch has launched a behavioural AI tool that distinguishes between human users and AI agents during online banking sessions — helping banks detect unauthorised automation, bot-driven fraud, and account takeover at login and transaction stages.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Detecting the agent in the room.</strong> As AI agents proliferate in both legitimate use and fraud, BioCatch's ability to fingerprint agent behaviour in real time gives banks a critical fraud-detection layer that complements existing identity and access controls.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 6 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            6. <strong>Northern Trust leans on Microsoft FDEs to boost agentic buildout</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPaWtEMWpmRU9mSnMzUm14Z3pvOGgzaFRWZHhWV1FfV1hRSXlOQU5fdW1iRkZZc1c2OURNT3I2N2VlQXFQbFVkSW96bHZaTEtST3ZUb3E4XzU1bmtjTkdvX3R1MzNjUk5nd1p0ci0tV0JIMG5HN1dhd2dRRUt6cnVJV252N3JaM3NNempQUzR3Rl9RQQ?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">CIO Dive</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Northern Trust is embedding Microsoft field deployment engineers directly into its AI buildout, using hands-on vendor expertise to accelerate agentic AI deployment across custody, fund administration, and wealth management operations.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>The co-deployment model is emerging.</strong> Northern Trust's approach — cloud vendor engineers working inside the bank — is becoming a blueprint for large financial institutions without sufficient internal AI headcount to execute ambitious agentic programmes alone.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer after last entry -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:4px;font-size:0